    (conv nttElement f)))





^{:go/end 288} (go/func inverseNTT "inverseNTT maps a nttElement back to the ringElement it represents.\n\nIt implements NTT⁻¹, according to FIPS 203, Algorithm 10.\n" ^ringElement [^nttElement f]
