^{:go/end 395} (go/func sampleInBall "sampleInBall samples a ringElement with coefficients in {−1, 0, 1}, and τ\nnon-zero coefficients. It is not constant-time.\n" ^ringElement [^{:tag (slice byte)} rho ^parameters p]
